.source.geojson; smaller reference corridors remain explicitly reconstructed. Variable-width ribbons replace filled compact basin patches, and active channel cores / declared unsuitable patches / open water are excluded from terminal placement. Post-arrival dispersal takes 300 modeled calendar years along the supplied land-checked path; these are display assumptions, not source arrival dates or observed settlements. Path and dates are reconstructed."}},"BALKAN":{"points":[[22.587684,44.757817],[28.626133,45.442931],[28.243395,45.304082],[20.013812,44.881797],[21.799404,42.695845],[22.994993,44.34763],[22.953468,44.577032],[27.314342,44.351071],[23.340964,43.741186],[19.587587,44.693121],[20.838898,44.911323],[21.650954,44.495554],[24.590775,43.913204],[21.844096,44.517025],[27.749038,45.130835],[19.070238,45.059124],[28.099681,44.714512],[19.339978,45.086914],[21.447293,44.431514],[22.47331,44.791162],[26.159735,44.197604],[22.507135,44.085858],[25.992233,43.667892],[18.756236,46.893271],[23.503189,44.075652],[21.87869,42.890573],[23.012039,44.071311],[19.135379,46.491514],[27.603718,44.042176],[18.671325,45.704669],[20.661922,45.032908],[25.289944,43.869994],[22.372517,44.483406],[21.049089,43.993164],[24.810279,43.572783],[19.237315,45.521229],[19.775646,45.047064],[28.300733,45.129879],[22.862918,44.402643],[22.5427,44.697926],[19.405673,44.80229],[18.695926,46.428686],[22.303156,42.977899],[20.64036,45.028825],[21.212435,44.532486],[24.179071,43.963644],[21.44405,44.642659],[23.642419,43.603059],[18.884244,46.085129],[18.612587,45.279115],[21.879022,44.714355],[21.340614,44.829775],[25.696009,44.001105],[22.366747,44.467026],[20.968924,44.518293],[19.814304,45.412606],[19.97808,44.917497],[28.320179,45.139371],[20.470108,44.701808],[23.224451,44.168172],[19.152356,46.763954],[19.700017,44.53263],[21.997396,43.425271],[21.909106,44.413703],[24.816065,43.903855],[21.922675,44.442444],[19.077382,45.668812],[19.205388,45.074387],[19.609711,45.055189],[21.46727,44.63